<title>HONG KONG: Zhejiang Expressway covers overallotment.</title>
<headline>Zhejiang Expressway covers overallotment.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zhejiang Expressway Co Ltd said on Thursday it would issue an additional 187.02 million new H-shares at HK$2.38 each to cover overallotment.</p>
<p>The additional H-shares are expected to be issued and listed on Friday, the company said.</p>
<p>After the issue, the total number of H-shares will be increased to 1.43 billion shares, or 33 percent of the company's enlarged share capital, from 1.25 billion shares or 30 percent of the share capital, it said.</p>
<p>Zhejiang Expressway listed on May 15. Its shares were up HK$0.075 at HK$2.925 in early trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
